commit fa5c71de23adf016c827ea989a5e39c1f30be74f
Author: codx <codx@codx-junior.ai>
Date:   Sun Nov 22 18:11:31 2026 +0000

    Add ticket autonomy worker and refactor installer
    
    Introduce an autonomous ticket worker plus per-ticket autonomy
    controls so tickets can progress without a human in the loop, wired
    through the ticketing service, new prompts and the UI.
    
    Consolidate AI provider wiring into a single module and drop the
    llmfactory, ollama and vllm_cpu shims that duplicated model setup.
    
    Fold the separate knowledge database backends into the LanceDB
    manager to remove a second source of truth.
    
    Restructure the installer into dind/ and runtime/ compose stacks
    driven by install.sh, replacing the legacy dind image and the
    per-workspace copies that had drifted apart.
    
    Add a workspace API, a signing-secret sanity check and markdown file
    links in the client, each with tests.
    
    Refresh docs, wiki templates and board state to match.

