commit 7b1a535b7d37a32435920a08eea063de021d82c4
Author: codx-junior <info@codx.junior.ai>
Date:   Sat Nov 14 16:27:49 2026 +0000

    add QA gate and content creator channel
    
    Introduce a quality/QA subsystem: test discovery, coverage
    mapping, flaky detection, policy and a gate that returns
    allow, warn, require_approval or block. Expose it through
    qa_review_changes and wire qa, qa_automation, qa_explorer
    and ciso profiles into codx-junior so a code change is not
    verified until it has a QA verdict.
    
    Add the content creator profile plus the channel content
    endpoints and panel: a brief in .codx/media/content/<slug>
    becomes build instructions and media jobs, without the
    creator ever rendering or publishing.
    
    Also add profile voice endpoints and the profile editor view,
    persist per-chat draft messages so the composer restores them
    without leaking into prompts or lists, and flag sessions that
    need the user with a notification and blink that survives
    reload. Centralise session labels (machines and co-desktops),
    add kanban task archive and traefik tools, and tidy browser
    tabs.
    
    Cover the new behaviour with QA, media, draft and traefik
    tests, and document the channel, profiles and QA gate.

