commit 4221916d5120f944ce747acf0bc1ac07ed70b79f
Author: codx <codx@codx-junior.ai>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 21:01:12 2026 +0000

    add log explorer and calendar M0 milestone
    
    Add a Grafana Loki / Graylog style logs explorer: parser and query
    language, level facets, histogram, virtualized list and a detail
    panel. The backend gains parsers, query, Docker/log sources, a
    service and a /api/logs/explorer router with unit tests and docs,
    so large log volumes can be searched instead of dumped.
    
    Ship calendar M0: file-backed store with ACL-filtered queries, the
    /api/calendar router and a Vue view with month/week grids, agenda,
    sidebar and store, since the current agenda is too limited.
    
    Extend orchestration with step removal and supervisor rounds,
    expose the harness audit journal in the UI, and refresh the task
    boards and profiles to reflect the new backlog. Temporary calendar
    check scripts are included for now.

